V2rayG bundled geodata
========================

The following upstream binary data files are redistributed without modification:

geosite.dat and geoip.dat
  Project: Loyalsoldier/v2ray-rules-dat
  Release: https://github.com/Loyalsoldier/v2ray-rules-dat/releases/tag/202609240010
  Source: https://github.com/Loyalsoldier/v2ray-rules-dat/tree/5c20d2eb5a65b171816949010ede67a27326cbe6
  Repository license: GNU General Public License version 3.

geoip-only-cn-private.dat
  Project: Loyalsoldier/geoip
  Release: https://github.com/Loyalsoldier/geoip/releases/tag/202609240030
  Source: https://github.com/Loyalsoldier/geoip/tree/1503074d8aee4c623791210e90c04d586c86c8f7
  Upstream identifies CC-BY-SA-4.0 and GPL-3.0 licenses.
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

The full geoip.dat is also generated by Loyalsoldier/geoip. Its upstream data
attributions and licenses apply in addition to the rules repository's license.
This product includes GeoLite2 data created by MaxMind, available from
https://www.maxmind.com/.
Chinese IP data is sourced upstream from gaoyifan/china-operator-ip:
https://github.com/gaoyifan/china-operator-ip

geosite.dat is generated upstream from v2fly/domain-list-community and
Loyalsoldier/domain-list-custom, with contributions including
felixonmars/dnsmasq-china-list, gfwlist/gfwlist, and other sources documented
in the pinned rules repository:
https://github.com/Loyalsoldier/v2ray-rules-dat/blob/5c20d2eb5a65b171816949010ede67a27326cbe6/README.md

Copyright remains with the respective authors and data contributors.
See the bundled GEODATA-LICENSE-GPL-3.0 and GEODATA-LICENSE-CC-BY-SA-4.0
for full license terms. V2rayG does not claim ownership of these datasets.
Binary checksums and source revisions are recorded in scripts/geodata-dependencies.env.
